{"suttaId":"tha-ap109","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[5274,5308],"vripara":"36"},"segments":{"tha-ap109:0.3":"Naḷamāliyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap109:1.1":"“Padumuttarabuddhassa, lokajeṭṭhassa tādino;","tha-ap109:1.3":"Tiṇatthare nisinnassa, upasantassa tādino.","tha-ap109:2.1":"“Naḷamālaṃ gahetvāna, bandhitvā [bījitvā (ka.)] bījaniṃ ahaṃ;","tha-ap109:2.3":"Buddhassa upanāmesiṃ, dvipadindassa tādino.","tha-ap109:3.1":"“Paṭiggahetvā sabbaññū, bījaniṃ lokanāyako;","tha-ap109:3.3":"Mama saṅkappamaññāya, imaṃ gāthaṃ abhāsatha.","tha-ap109:4.1":"“‘Yathā me kāyo nibbāti, pariḷāho na vijjati;","tha-ap109:4.3":"Tatheva tividhaggīhi, cittaṃ tava vimuccatu’.","tha-ap109:5.1":"“Sabbe devā samāgacchuṃ, ye keci vananissitā;","tha-ap109:5.3":"Sossāma buddhavacanaṃ, hāsayantañca dāyakaṃ.","tha-ap109:6.1":"“Nisinno bhagavā tattha, devasaṅghapurakkhato;","tha-ap109:6.3":"Dāyakaṃ sampahaṃsento, imā gāthā abhāsatha.","tha-ap109:7.1":"“‘Iminā bījanidānena, cittassa paṇidhīhi ca;","tha-ap109:7.3":"Subbato nāma nāmena, cakkavattī bhavissati.","tha-ap109:8.1":"“‘Tena kammāvasesena, sukkamūlena codito;","tha-ap109:8.3":"Māluto nāma nāmena, cakkavattī bhavissati’.","tha-ap109:9.1":"“‘Iminā bījanidānena, sammānavipulena ca;","tha-ap109:9.3":"Kappasatasahassampi, duggatiṃ nupapajjati.","tha-ap109:10.1":"“Tiṃsakappasahassamhi, subbatā aṭṭhatiṃsa te;","tha-ap109:10.3":"Ekūnatiṃsasahasse, aṭṭha mālutanāmakā.","tha-ap109:11.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap109:12.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā naḷamāliyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap109:13.1":"Naḷamāliyattherassāpadānaṃ sattamaṃ.","tha-ap109:13.2":"Sattamabhāṇavāraṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2825,"to":2826,"paras":[{"para":2825,"vripara":"36","refs":["tha-ap109:1"],"lines":["So aparabhāge attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>padumuttarabuddhassā</b>tiādimāha.","Taṃ heṭṭhā vuttameva."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap109:1"],["tha-ap109:1"]]},{"para":2826,"vripara":"37","refs":["tha-ap109:2"],"lines":["<b>Naḷamālaṃ gahetvānā</b>ti naḷati asāro nissāro hutvā veḷuvaṃsatopi tanuko sallahuko jātoti naḷo, naḷassa mālā pupphaṃ naḷamālaṃ, tena naḷamālena bījaniṃ kāresinti sambandho.","Bījissati janissati vāto anenāti bījanī, taṃ bījaniṃ buddhassa upanāmesiṃ, paṭiggahesinti attho.","Sesaṃ sabbattha uttānamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap109:2"],["tha-ap109:2"],["tha-ap109:2"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap109:1.1","padumuttarabuddhassā",0,0],["tha-ap109:2.1","naḷamālaṃ gahetvānā",1,0]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
